{
  "name": "19 - RAG Chatbot for Company Documents",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 19 - RAG Chatbot for Company Documents\n\n**What it does:**\nIndexes Google Drive documents into Pinecone vector DB. A Slack bot answers staff questions using your company docs as context (RAG).\n\n**Two sub-workflows:**\n1. **Ingestion** (Google Drive trigger) — indexes new/updated docs\n2. **Query** (Slack webhook) — answers questions from Slack\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Configure Google Drive OAuth credentials\n2. Configure OpenAI credentials (for embeddings + chat)\n3. Configure Pinecone credentials + set INDEX_NAME\n4. Set up Slack slash command `/ask` pointing to the Query webhook URL\n5. Set PINECONE_INDEX in the Set node\n\n**Pinecone index settings:**\n- Dimensions: 1536 (text-embedding-ada-002)\n- Metric: cosine",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 360
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000001",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Part 1: Document Ingestion\nTriggered when a new file is added to Google Drive",
        "height": 60,
        "width": 300
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000002",
      "name": "Ingestion Label",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Part 2: Query Handler\nAnswers questions via Slack slash command",
        "height": 60,
        "width": 300
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000003",
      "name": "Query Label",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 700]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [{ "mode": "everyMinute" }]
        },
        "triggerOn": "specificFolder",
        "folderToWatch": {
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID",
          "cachedResultName": "Company Docs"
        },
        "event": "fileCreated",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000004",
      "name": "Google Drive — New File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDriveTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "gdrive-cred",
          "name": "Google Drive"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "download",
        "fileId": {
          "value": "={{ $json.id }}",
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000005",
      "name": "Download File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [480, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "gdrive-cred",
          "name": "Google Drive"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Split document text into ~500 token chunks with overlap\nconst text = $input.item.binary?.data \n  ? Buffer.from($input.item.binary.data, 'base64').toString('utf-8')\n  : $input.item.json.content || '';\n\nconst fileName = $input.item.json.name || 'unknown';\nconst fileId = $input.item.json.id || 'unknown';\n\nconst chunkSize = 1500; // ~500 tokens\nconst overlap = 200;\nconst chunks = [];\n\nfor (let i = 0; i < text.length; i += chunkSize - overlap) {\n  const chunk = text.slice(i, i + chunkSize).trim();\n  if (chunk.length > 50) {\n    chunks.push({\n      chunk_text: chunk,\n      chunk_index: chunks.length,\n      file_name: fileName,\n      file_id: fileId,\n      source: `Google Drive: ${fileName}`\n    });\n  }\n}\n\nreturn chunks.map(c => ({ json: c }));"
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000006",
      "name": "Chunk Document",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [720, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/embeddings",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $credentials.openAiApi.apiKey }}" },
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "model", "value": "text-embedding-ada-002" },
            { "name": "input", "value": "={{ $json.chunk_text }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000007",
      "name": "Generate Embedding",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [960, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "openai-cred",
          "name": "OpenAI API Key"
        }
      },
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://{{ $env.PINECONE_INDEX }}-{{ $env.PINECONE_PROJECT }}.svc.{{ $env.PINECONE_ENV }}.pinecone.io/vectors/upsert",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Api-Key", "value": "={{ $env.PINECONE_API_KEY }}" },
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"vectors\": [{\n    \"id\": \"{{ $('Chunk Document').item.json.file_id }}_{{ $('Chunk Document').item.json.chunk_index }}\",\n    \"values\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.data[0].embedding) }},\n    \"metadata\": {\n      \"text\": \"{{ $('Chunk Document').item.json.chunk_text.replace(/\"/g, \"'\") }}\",\n      \"source\": \"{{ $('Chunk Document').item.json.source }}\",\n      \"file_name\": \"{{ $('Chunk Document').item.json.file_name }}\"\n    }\n  }]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000008",
      "name": "Upsert to Pinecone",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1200, 300],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "rag-query",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000009",
      "name": "Slack Query Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 800],
      "webhookId": "rag-query-webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "q-001",
              "name": "question",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.text || $json.body.question }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "q-002",
              "name": "user",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.user_name || 'user' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000010",
      "name": "Extract Question",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [480, 800]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/embeddings",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.OPENAI_API_KEY }}" },
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "model", "value": "text-embedding-ada-002" },
            { "name": "input", "value": "={{ $json.question }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000011",
      "name": "Embed Question",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [720, 800]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://{{ $env.PINECONE_INDEX }}-{{ $env.PINECONE_PROJECT }}.svc.{{ $env.PINECONE_ENV }}.pinecone.io/query",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Api-Key", "value": "={{ $env.PINECONE_API_KEY }}" },
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"vector\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.data[0].embedding) }},\n  \"topK\": 5,\n  \"includeMetadata\": true\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000012",
      "name": "Search Pinecone",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [960, 800]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const matches = $input.item.json.matches || [];\nconst context = matches\n  .map((m, i) => `[Source ${i+1}: ${m.metadata?.file_name || 'unknown'}]\\n${m.metadata?.text || ''}`) \n  .join('\\n\\n');\n\nconst question = $('Extract Question').item.json.question;\n\nreturn [{ json: { context, question, match_count: matches.length } }];"
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000013",
      "name": "Build Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1200, 800]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.OPENROUTER_API_KEY }}" },
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
            { "name": "HTTP-Referer", "value": "flowmindlabs.co" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"You are a helpful assistant that answers questions using only the provided company documents. If the answer is not in the documents, say so clearly. Always cite the source document name.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Context from company documents:\\n\\n{{ $json.context }}\\n\\nQuestion: {{ $json.question }}\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"max_tokens\": 800\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000014",
      "name": "Claude — Answer Question",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1440, 800],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={\n  \"response_type\": \"in_channel\",\n  \"text\": \"*Answer for @{{ $('Extract Question').item.json.user }}:*\\n{{ $json.choices[0].message.content }}\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000015",
      "name": "Respond to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1680, 800]
    }
  ],
